The map image (Plan Topographique du Bosphore de Thrace ou Canal de
Constantinople et de ses environs, Kauffer / Barbié du Bocage, 1819) is in the
public domain. The scan is by the Bibliothèque nationale de France (Gallica,
ark:/12148/btv1b10100957j) and is served by Wikimedia Commons. It is not
redistributed in this repository; the app loads it from Wikimedia at runtime.

The label data in public/labels.json and pipeline/out/chunks/ is released
under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication).
